## FOLDER ORGANIZATION
The project uses a modular structure under `/src`:
- `/src/preparation`: Scripts for data preparation and initial processing. Includes `generate_schema.py`, `get_mp_party_affiliations.py`, `db_handler.py`, `scrape_parliament.py`, `parliament_urls.py`.
- `/src/parsing`: Scripts for parsing and extracting data from various sources. Includes `pdf_gemini_pipeline.py`.
- `/src/cleaning`: Scripts for data cleaning and standardization. Includes `vector_match.py`, `standardize_entities.py`, `split_entities.py`, `verify_fuzzy_matches_llm.py`, `update_db_from_llm.py`, `summarize_gemini_entity_analysis.py`, `prepare_gemini_entity_analysis.py`, `double_disclosure_analysis.py`, `analyze_double_disclosures_with_gemini.py`, `remove_nil_entries.py`, `fix_identicals_final.py`, `fix_identical_items.py`, `extract_items.py`, `recategorize_all.py`, `recategorize_unknowns.py`, `standardize_mp_names.py`, `standardize_electorates.py`, `clean_entities.py`, `update_categories.py`, `merge_entities.py`.
- `/src/output`: Directory for storing processed and analyzed data.
- `/src/common`: Directory for utility functions and common modules. Includes `utils.py` and `rate_limiter.py`.

All other files and folders have been either deleted or moved as part of the 2025-04-19 refactor.  See `development_diary.rmd` for a complete log.  `ocr_processor.py` and `gemini_processor.py` removed from pipeline per user request on 2025-04-19.


